🌐 Opening https://fleet.blackbuck.com…
   👉 LOG IN MANUALLY in the browser window
   👉 Navigate to the fleet/vehicles dashboard
   👉 Then test with: curl http://localhost:3000/api/fetch-blackbuck

🔄 Attempting automated login…
   📍 On login page, attempting to find "Login with password"…
   ⏳ Waiting for session stabilization…
   🔄 Navigating to GPS dashboard…

🚀 Proxy running on http://localhost:3000
   Test: curl http://localhost:3000/api/health
   Fetch: curl http://localhost:3000/api/fetch-blackbuck
   Debug: curl http://localhost:3000/api/debug/captured

   👉 Log into Blackbuck in the browser, then use Suprwise!

